Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world is awash in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Great War was the biggest war in human history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it left the world's nations with deep scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Its conclusion brought about\Na radical change in world affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a special mission for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As of tomorrow, you're splitting off\Nfrom the team for a solo op.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's what they call an Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The success rate on 'em is under ten percent,\Nand failure means death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If those are your orders, Master, then consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about this, Idiot Pupil?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you make it back alive, I've got a new title for you:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Greatest Spy in the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd say you will have earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's got a nice ring to it, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The politicians all realized how poor the\Ncost-performance of war was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Due to how advanced modern science was,\Nweapons were too effective at killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With that, the era of nations pointing their guns at\Neach other out in the open came to an end...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's three guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're at range fifteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.79,0:01:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone was able to escape\NMr. Bernard's surveillance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's gotta mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...we're dealing with a spy, and a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, battles are fought between spies\Nover information
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in shadow wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since the Great War's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here in the Din Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we've used that time to build spy academies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and put students through harsh training.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now, I finally get to graduate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll remind you that it's only\Na provisional graduation, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a newly-formed spy team\Nthat says they just have to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:03:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As of today, the Cabinet Office is going\Nto be borrowing you for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The notice says you'll learn the details on-site.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It also said to wear those.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Code name Flower Garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,ready to put my life on the line, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, this outfit makes it feel more like\NI'm transferring than graduating...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, though, I'm moving up in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey mister, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:42.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Eight years...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:47.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's a wonder they kept me around so long\Nafter I came so close to failing out so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our next stop is Port City Arranq.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll be arriving in Arranq soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:03.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I want to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:05.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All righty! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! This is Garmouth Seminary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm your awesome new transfer student!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Head on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, the chapel should be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-this is bad!\NI'm running late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a gorgeous manor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's what the headquarters look like when the\NCabinet Office itself puts together a new spy team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This must be where all the talented\Nveteran spies are waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no! We're supposed to be gathered by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Code name Flower Garden is in the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A bunch of girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That isn't a good look for a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like she's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and she's more of the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, with the silver hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got any field experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What were your academy grades like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, uh, I'm here on a provisional graduation...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and to be honest, I was kind of a washout...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Er, he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what's that red stuff on his clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:23.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This spy team is called Lamplight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I'm Klaus, the team's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight was put together to specialize\Nin Impossible Missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:34.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Together, myself and the seven of you here\Nmake up its full roster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One month from now,\Nwe'll be taking on an Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Training starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For today, your job is to get to know your teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Lamplight"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell's that guy thinkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, who goes and gathers up a bunch of\Nproblem students to do an Impossible Mission with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You heard me.\NWe're all washouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our academies were all too happy to get rid of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.83,0:07:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He left us something...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Communal Living Rules"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To live here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's start by having dinner together, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, all seven of us are from different academies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a weird coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, I suspect that isn't a coincidence at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I think so too, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The one thing we have in common is, we're all washouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the record, I was half-assing it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something strange about the manor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are traces of people having lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it swanky, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We each get a room all to ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no, there's something fishy about all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, Impossible Missions...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...are difficult tasks with mortality rates of\Nover ninety percent, even for first-rate spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do one with an entire group of\Nunderperforming washouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, it'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That Klaus guy was practically radiating competence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's going to do a great job training us all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We all tried hard back at our academies, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, let's kill it out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.75,0:08:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see that you've all gotten to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today, we start our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before we get into all that,\NI've got some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this mission we're going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why exactly did you pick us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't give you any specifics right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One month from now, we'll be infiltrating\Nthe hostile Galgad Empire
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and completing an Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the moment, that's all I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not much of an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can any of you open these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, this mechanism is way too tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'd take me at least fifteen minutes to-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you've taken my lessons,\Nyou'll be able to do the same in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that's what a first-rate spy looks like in action!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Over the next month,\NI'll be training you here in Heat Haze Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,until you're strong enough to\Ncomplete Impossible Missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does anyone still have reservations?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, sir!\NOh, I'm so glad I came here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, as far as the lockpicking lesson goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...just use your picking tool correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That concludes the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, run that by me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And a little more clearly, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That concludes the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the locks will open\Nif you use your picking tool correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I trust you see that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should make like a honeybee tickling a stamen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to be more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, Teach, we were hoping for\Nmore of an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I just gave you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were you really unable to follow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking about having the next set of lectures\Nbe the "talk beautifully" lesson on negotiation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the "just take them down" lesson on combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the "it'll all work out" lesson on disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll be able to follow any of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the rest of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm only just learning this, but apparently,\NI'm quite bad at teaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The rest of the day will be self-study.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on one dang second!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that guy off his rocker?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How the hell are we supposed to complete\Nthis Impossible Mission?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we're gonna get slaughtered, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't like it, but that's where we stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Settle down, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Teach has some sort of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I think I figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have a group of washouts and\Na teacher who can't teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think he's using us as sacrificial pawns!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That teacher of ours has no intention of\Ngetting the seven of us out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:28.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I mean, I became a spy because\NI wanted to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:30.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If we're just going to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:36.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,then what did we even bother getting driven out\Nof our academies and coming here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We might be washouts, but we still have dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we still have our pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Flower Garden...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to bloom out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As for me, it's as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to come up with new teaching methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It definitely just looks like you're painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:24.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He titled it "Family"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, books about education?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you're actually taking this pretty seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got any ideas yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not a one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's quite the quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, Teach, how about we go sightseeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, as a breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A nice change of pace can help the creative juices flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't say the idea speaks to me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you have anywhere in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I made a list of all the local attractions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's take a little break tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so this is the famous Maple Lane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are so many people here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean to say that last bit out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I expected the others to be here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they all turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's get them\Nsome souvenirs before we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good idea! What should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's an excellent question...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about some canned goods?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to recent advances in\Nvacuum-sealing technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.17,0:14:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we've been getting some excellent imports\Nthese past few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sardines canned in oil pair fantastically with pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:40.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After you boil your pasta,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you can take a frying pan and fry up some\Nchopped vegetables with your sardines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you've boiled off most of the juices,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,all you have to do is pour it over your pasta\Nand add spices to taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that sounds tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! You explained that recipe just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone, stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're too kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how'd you do that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did you put on your shirt this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, I put my arm in the sleeve-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Which arm did you start with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you rotate your waist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you bend your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did you do up your buttons?\NWhat about your collar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-how am I supposed to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's precisely how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're saying that you did that thing just now\Nand the lockpicking yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,without having to consciously think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I can say that I used the picking tool correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there's no way for me to come up with specific,\Nsystemic explanations that would make sense to others,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because I performed the actions on instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So in other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the problem is that your intuition is just too darn good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that means there really is\Nno way you'll be able to teach us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember, Teach, we're here to take a load off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To forget all about our pesky problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You seem quite adept at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sunset is so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go there next!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's super crowded here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Emai Lake, the most popular\Ntourist attraction in the region.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you take a boat to the middle of the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you can enjoy Mother Nature in all her splendor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With how crowded it is, though,\NI suspect all the rental boats will be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today's our lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's one boat left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the man's job to get in first,\Nmake sure it's safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and offer the lady his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never forget this sight, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never forget the natural views so picturesque\Nthat you want to embrace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never forget the smiles you saw at the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never forget the people cherishing their loved ones\Nunder the setting sun's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone once planted a bomb in\Nthat very same Maple Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were an Imperial agent trying to\Nassassinate one of our politicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the people who promptly got ahold of\Nthat intel and put a stop to the plot...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.63,0:18:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...were our fellow spies from the Republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This world of ours is awash in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The war's scars still linger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but our people are slowly starting\Nto find their smiles again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only people who can protect them are spies like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what, I should just become a sacrificial pawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why you gathered up a\Nbunch of washouts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if I die now,\Nthen my whole life will have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only thing that got me through those\Nharsh years at the academy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was the idea that someday, I'd be able to bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get how important this mission must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't accompany you, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really, truly mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Flower Garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to bloom out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Poison gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just a paralytic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got hit too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This poison doesn't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got an abnormal physiology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was how I became my village's\Nsole survivor during the Great War.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is inhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those Imperial bastards used this place as\Na testing ground for their new weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's someone still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back then, a spy saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only reason the army sent a team there was\Nbecause spies told them what had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I've been trying so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to become a spy and save my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to change the world, even just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But when we spent the day together,\NI became sure of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we stay on Lamplight, we're just going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a poison specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your defeat was sealed\Nthe moment you got on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.25,0:20:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you hoping to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.75,0:20:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want Lamplight disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I want you to get us all jobs on other spy teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's within your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone's certainly feeling greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you won't cooperate,\NI'll stab you with this poison needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll put you out like a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, your goal is to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm sorry about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it was the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:42.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Recognize that you've lost and agree to do what I-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I recognize your efforts, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I have to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how much longer should I keep\Nplaying along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shackles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When did you set those up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:20:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're sinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.83,0:21:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In spite of its incredible popularity,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Emai Lake was conspicuously absent from\Nthat sightseeing list you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It stank to high heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if you were going to pull something\Nin a place as busy as this lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the logical place to do it would be on a boat\Nwhere you could make sure nobody else was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was an obvious enough conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I played things too safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I left the lake off my list so you couldn't\Npredict where I would attack you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it looks like that backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could you have known we would take this boat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Out Of Order"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see from your seat,\Nbut it's plain as day to the rower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This boat was always going to be the last one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:45.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You set all this up last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, you did that to divert my attention?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You already showed me your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You aren't qualified to be my enemy, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On top of all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I realized you were plotting to attack me\Nthe moment you came to my room last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.21,0:22:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot for expecting anything out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and give me the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boat's going to sink soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like I might have accidently left it in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got a key for these shackles, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you found it while I was immobilized,\NI would lose my leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured I could unlock you myself\Nonce I got the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-nothing to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:48.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In ten minutes, the poison will have worked\Nits way out of your system all on its-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.17,0:22:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, we have five minutes until the boat sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.13,0:22:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Row like your life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I lost completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it's once a washout, always a washout.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was some excellent poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you probably let yourself\Nget hit on purpose, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did. I wanted to test your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This situation couldn't get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're terrible students, you suck at teaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.33,0:23:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and Impossible Missions are as deadly as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I just have to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.71,0:23:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And all I wanted was to bloom into\Na spy I could be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:48.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.46,0:23:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our battle may have been little more than a game,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the fact you saw the impending crisis\Nand took steps to prevent it faster than anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:23:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was unreservedly...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fl-flattery will get you nowhere, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, I want you to become Lamplight's leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.25,0:24:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll still be the team's boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.33,0:24:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we need someone for\Nthe rest of you to rally around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.13,0:24:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's work together to make this mission a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.63,0:24:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.17,0:24:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds so cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But what's this about completing the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You still can't teach you way out of a-
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, I solved that problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just came up with a new teaching method,\Nand it's all thanks to you, Flower Garden Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, I've gathered you all here again,\Nand it's as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.29,0:24:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not sure how we're supposed to see that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.17,0:24:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My poor explanations caused a misunderstanding,\Nand I'd like to start by clearing it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,None of you are sacrificial pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going to live, and we're going to\Ncomplete that Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I hand-selected this group\Nof magnificent members for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let a single one of you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but I heard that Impossible Missions
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.08,0:25:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,have a ninety percent mortality rate,\Neven for first-rate spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.79,0:25:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way we survive-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what you have me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm no paltry first-rate spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.13,0:25:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the Greatest Spy in the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.25,0:25:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we work together,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.54,0:25:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this Impossible Mission is going to be child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.21,0:25:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"The Greatest Spy in the World"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.88,0:25:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds so childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.13,0:25:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.38,0:25:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach is going to lead Lamplight to greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.29,0:25:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As your team leader, I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.46,0:25:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've already figured out a curriculum\Nthat will improve your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.83,0:26:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that marked our first step as spies
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.17,0:26:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,into a classroom of deception.
